    <description>
        Orange mesh used as the pick-and-place target object.
        Original model by Adwait Naik, published on Gazebo Fuel as Gambit/Orange.
        Source: https://app.gazebosim.org/Gambit/fuel/models/Orange
        Files used: textured.dae, texture_map.png (meshes/ subfolder).
        Modifications: none — mesh is used as-is. Visual pose corrected in
        grocery_world.sdf for Y_UP to Z_UP axis convention and mesh origin offset.
    </description>
</model>
